  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1f3b527142094e27ea4dd3da078ac204f0dab2f2.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fchomik_oto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e57558e6fff9baa59db405ece347f9274cb593ee.webp\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252f3d-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f5e493b29e9cadd97cdc6a4428821b6f95eefd55.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJqmSYqyuu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4deece41b27fd615591464722fbfaa563b57f7b.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更多詳情：</strong></p></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">每個熔爐（熔爐、高爐、煙燻爐）都擁有真正的 3D 模型，內部為中空設計，並使用原版紋理，非常契合原版風格！</p>\n<p>‎</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6ad846c2464bf9f47d269736ef632ff87a715f84_0.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3D 熔爐展示：</strong></p></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>熔爐</strong></th>\n<th><strong>高爐：</strong></th>\n<th><strong>煙燻爐</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/682bd3cbe9670ba619c3553fb7e8305f996e056d.png\" alt=\"熔爐展示 1\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd910c62b710d44cd707d6e97c6821422c4dd33f.png\" alt=\"高爐展示 1\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f97b18802e88a89897465ccdf49a51b79b93716b_0.webp\" alt=\"煙燻爐展示 1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39bc7d5f61f3dac816b4036fcc68bf0c300fac8e.png\" alt=\"熔爐展示 2\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/893495fdc887d40987bad74ab019676b466870a2_0.webp\" alt=\"高爐展示 2\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1c71804becfd4488e7b818117e4b3b836103f42_0.webp\" alt=\"煙燻爐展示 2\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8fc7dc8686a1ca58808fdad63a371f960dd95c_0.webp\" alt=\"熔爐展示 3\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/04bc25f59bbcce3cb3f26ce1b0c97410763d2a4a.png\" alt=\"高爐展示 3\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/731e942049a89cb9d8f6ca7d8df84ab15a19cdc8_0.webp\" alt=\"煙燻爐展示 3\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請查看圖庫以查看更多圖片！</strong></p></h3>\n<p>‎</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6ad846c2464bf9f47d269736ef632ff87a715f84_0.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>‎</p>\n<h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>獲取更多我的「真正 3D」資源包！</strong></p></h1>\n<h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">（在 Modrinth 上）</p></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252factually-3d-ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/852711e47145875047f2ae6e0d2b0037b285e62f.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c374c6612526aa5466c785547fb9c5095faf6f1_0.webp\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252f3d-workbenches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/efc9c439890e2458a49c79a6a987ffd640c3292b.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>未來計畫：</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是我的「真正 3D」資源包系列的首個作品，希望未來能持續擴展，為遊戲中現有的方塊甚至物品新增新穎且細緻的 3D 模型！我計畫將每個子包（例如：熔爐、工作台、礦石等）獨立發佈，同時也會將其整合到主「真正 3D」資源包中，讓所有「真正 3D」資源包合而為一。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fWUhIlXT7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/02c09bf73e5f9b9a9f2a4d9a4c01ad8642e6e4b7.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a></p></div>",
